        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Ideogram 4.5- Image Edit\n\nGenerate edited or combined images from a text prompt and up to five input images using Ideogram 4.5, where image 1 is the image to edit and images 2-5 are references for design, material, or colour. Canvas size, quality level, and seed are adjustable, and one image is output. Ideal for product and outfit swaps, applying a reference design or palette to an existing photo, and recomposing a shot into a different aspect ratio. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_ideogram_v4_5_image_edit.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
